    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 1480691,
    "poster_id": 86235,
    "post_rendered": "Denote by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/e/a1e6cd0e4103015efba12e0fc4291f012b467eaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" > the set of all positive integers. Find all functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/e/0de1013acc9e1a94cc927e5a650a1181e6d23c2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\mathbb{N}\\rightarrow \\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" > such that for all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\"  width=\"15\" height=\"8\" > and <span style=\"white-space:pre;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\"  width=\"10\" height=\"8\" >,</span> the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/8/ee81e51f69e7355bca6e01290815d21e1804ae17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m)+f(n)-mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" > is nonzero and divides <span style=\"white-space:pre;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/f/a5f99a793d2d7713aca6cb2ed6f05fe425a844d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mf(m)+nf(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" >.</span><br>\n<br>\n<i>Proposed by Dorlir Ahmeti, Albania</i>",
    "post_canonical": "Denote by $\\mathbb{N}$ the set of all positive integers. Find all functions $f:\\mathbb{N}\\rightarrow \\mathbb{N}$ such that for all positive integers $m$ and $n$, the integer $f(m)+f(n)-mn$ is nonzero and divides $mf(m)+nf(n)$.\n\n[i]Proposed by Dorlir Ahmeti, Albania[/i]",
